#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:1
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Exploring why native executables produced with Mandrel 23.1 are bigger than those produced with Mandrel 23.0"
msgstr "Análisis de las razones por las que los ejecutables nativos generados con Mandrel 23.1 tienen un tamaño mayor que los generados con Mandrel 23.0"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "This article is a follow-up to [Exploring why native executables produced with Mandrel 23.0 are bigger than with Mandrel 22.3](/blog/mandrel-23-0-image-size-increase/).\n"
msgstr "Este artículo es una continuación de [«Análisis de por qué los ejecutables nativos generados con Mandrel 23.0 son más grandes que los generados con Mandrel 22.3»](/blog/mandrel-23-0-image-size-increase/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:13
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Starting with Quarkus 3.5 the default Mandrel version was updated from 23.0 to 23.1.\n"
msgstr "A partir de Quarkus 3.5, la versión predeterminada de Mandrel se actualizó de la 23.0 a la 23.1.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:15
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "This update brought a number of bugfixes as well as new features like:\n"
msgstr "Esta actualización ha incorporado una serie de correcciones de errores, así como nuevas funciones como:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Preview of [Foreign Function & Memory API downcalls](https://github.com/oracle/graal/blob/master/docs/reference-manual/native-image/ForeignInterface.md) (part of \"Project Panama\", [JEP 442](https://openjdk.org/jeps/442)) on AMD64. Must be enabled with `--enable-preview`.\n"
msgstr "Vista previa de [Llamadas a funciones externas y a la API de memoria](https://github.com/oracle/graal/blob/master/docs/reference-manual/native-image/ForeignInterface.md) (parte del «Proyecto Panamá», [JEP 442](https://openjdk.org/jeps/442)) en AMD64. Debe habilitarse con `--enable-preview`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "New option `-H:±IndirectBranchTargetMarker` to mark indirect branch targets on AMD64 with an endbranch instruction. This is a prerequisite for future Intel CET support.\n"
msgstr "Nueva opción `-H:±IndirectBranchTargetMarker` para marcar los destinos de ramificación indirecta en AMD64 mediante una instrucción «endbranch». Se trata de un requisito previo para la futura compatibilidad con la tecnología CET de Intel.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Throw `MissingReflectionRegistrationError` when attempting to create a proxy class without having it registered at build-time, instead of a `VMError`.\n"
msgstr "Lance un `MissingReflectionRegistrationError` al intentar crear una clase proxy sin haberla registrado en el momento de la compilación, en lugar de un `VMError`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Support for `-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError`.\n"
msgstr "Compatibilidad con `-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "New `--parallelism` option to control how many threads are used by the build process.\n"
msgstr "Nueva opción `--parallelism` para controlar el número de subprocesos que utiliza el proceso de compilación.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Simulation of class initializer: Class initializer of classes that are not marked for initialization at image build time are simulated at image build time to avoid executing them at image run time.\n"
msgstr "Simulación del inicializador de clase: Los inicializadores de las clases que no están marcadas para su inicialización en el momento de la compilación de la imagen se simulan en ese mismo momento, con el fin de evitar su ejecución durante la ejecución de la imagen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "and [more](https://github.com/oracle/graal/blob/master/substratevm/CHANGELOG.md#graalvm-for-jdk-21-internal-version-2310)\n"
msgstr "y [más](https://github.com/oracle/graal/blob/master/substratevm/CHANGELOG.md#graalvm-for-jdk-21-internal-version-2310)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, it also brought an unwanted side effect.\n"
"The native executables produced with Mandrel 23.1 are bigger than the ones produced with Mandrel 23.0.\n"
"To better understand why that happens we perform a thorough analysis to attribute the size increase to specific changes in Mandrel's code base.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, también trajo consigo un efecto secundario no deseado.\n"
"Los ejecutables nativos generados con Mandrel 23.1 son más grandes que los generados con Mandrel 23.0.\n"
"Para comprender mejor por qué ocurre esto, llevamos a cabo un análisis exhaustivo con el fin de atribuir el aumento de tamaño a cambios específicos en el código fuente de Mandrel.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "TL;DR"
msgstr "TL;DR"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:31
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "According to our analysis the binary size increase is attributed to two distinct changes, both of which are necessary for getting more accurate profiles when using the [async-sampler](https://github.com/oracle/graal/discussions/7707#discussioncomment-7443058).\n"
msgstr "Según nuestro análisis, el aumento del tamaño del archivo binario se debe a dos cambios distintos, ambos necesarios para obtener perfiles más precisos al utilizar el [async-sampler](https://github.com/oracle/graal/discussions/7707#discussioncomment-7443058).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:34
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "[**Add support for profiling of topmost frame**](https://github.com/oracle/graal/pull/7003)\n"
msgstr "[**Añadir compatibilidad con el análisis de rendimiento del fotograma superior**](https://github.com/oracle/graal/pull/7003)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:34
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "[**ProfilingSampler does not need local variable values**](https://github.com/oracle/graal/pull/6763) (specifically [the commit \"Always store bci in frame info\"](https://github.com/oracle/graal/commit/d747c30c7691012c39989a8597fd850c68b740ad))\n"
msgstr "[**ProfilingSampler no necesita los valores de las variables locales**](https://github.com/oracle/graal/pull/6763) (concretamente [la confirmación «Always store bci in frame info»](https://github.com/oracle/graal/commit/d747c30c7691012c39989a8597fd850c68b740ad))\n"

#. type: Title ##
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:35
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Better understanding what is different between the generated native executables"
msgstr "Comprender mejor en qué se diferencian los ejecutables nativos generados"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To perform the analysis we use the [Quarkus startstop test](https://github.com/quarkus-qe/quarkus-startstop) (specifically commit `a8bae846881607e376c7c8a96116b6b50ee50b70`) which generates, starts, tests, and stops small Quarkus applications and measures various time-related metrics (e.g. time-to-first-OK-request) and memory usage.\n"
"We get the test with:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para realizar el análisis, utilizamos la [prueba «startstop» de Quarkus](https://github.com/quarkus-qe/quarkus-startstop) (concretamente, el commit `a8bae846881607e376c7c8a96116b6b50ee50b70`), que genera, inicia, prueba y detiene pequeñas aplicaciones de Quarkus, y mide diversas métricas relacionadas con el tiempo (por ejemplo, el tiempo hasta la primera solicitud con resultado «OK») y el uso de memoria.\n"
"Obtenemos la prueba con:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:40
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/quarkus-qe/quarkus-startstop\n"
"cd quarkus-startstop\n"
"git checkout a8bae846881607e376c7c8a96116b6b50ee50b70\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/quarkus-qe/quarkus-startstop\n"
"cd quarkus-startstop\n"
"git checkout a8bae846881607e376c7c8a96116b6b50ee50b70\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:47
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "and build it with:\n"
msgstr "y compílelo con:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:48
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mvn clean package -Pnative -Dquarkus.version=3.5.0\\\n"
"    -Dquarkus.native.builder-image=quay.io/quarkus/ubi-quarkus-mandrel-builder-image:jdk-17\n"
msgstr ""
"mvn clean package -Pnative -Dquarkus.version=3.5.0\\\n"
"    -Dquarkus.native.builder-image=quay.io/quarkus/ubi-quarkus-mandrel-builder-image:jdk-17\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:54
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "changing the builder image tag to `jdk-20` and `jdk-21` for building with Mandrel 23.0 (based on JDK 20) and Mandrel 23.1 (based on JDK 21) respectively.\n"
msgstr "Cambiar la etiqueta de la imagen del compilador a `jdk-20` y `jdk-21` para compilar con Mandrel 23.0 (basado en JDK 20) y Mandrel 23.1 (basado en JDK 21), respectivamente.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:56
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "The reason we also use `jdk-20` although deprecated is to see the effects of the base JDK when using the same code base (`jdk-17` and `jdk-20` are based on the same Mandrel source code but are built using a different base JDK version).\n"
msgstr "El motivo por el que también utilizamos `jdk-20`, a pesar de que está obsoleto, es para observar los efectos del JDK base al utilizar el mismo código base (`jdk-17` y `jdk-20` se basan en el mismo código fuente de Mandrel, pero se compilan utilizando una versión diferente del JDK base).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:58
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Looking at the build output (generated by Quarkus in `target/my-app-native-image-sources/my-app-build-output-stats.json`) the main differences between the three builds are in the following metrics:\n"
msgstr "Al examinar los resultados de la compilación (generados por Quarkus en `target/my-app-native-image-sources/my-app-build-output-stats.json`), las principales diferencias entre las tres compilaciones se observan en las siguientes métricas:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2023-11-08-mandrel-23-1-image-size-increase.md:66
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Mandrel version | 23.0.2.1 (jdk-17) | 23.0.1.2 (jdk-20) | 23.1.1.0 (jdk-21) | Increase jdk-17 to jdk-20 % | Increase jdk-20 to jdk-21 % |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Image Heap Size | 29790208 | 30982144 | 33546240 | 4 | 8.3 |\n"
"| Objects count | 351565 | 353273 | 356059 | 0.5 | 0.8 |\n"
"| Resources Size | 169205 | 174761 | 175392 | 3.3 | 0.36 |\n"
"| Resources Count | 28 | 28 | 79 | 0 | 182 |\n"
"| Total Image Size | 60006728 | 61734352 | 64224536 | 2.88 | 4 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Versión de Mandrel | 23.0.2.1 (jdk-17) | 23.0.1.2 (jdk-20) | 23.1.1.0 (jdk-21) | Porcentaje de aumento de JDK-17 a JDK-20 | Porcentaje de aumento de JDK-20 a JDK-21 |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Tamaño del montón de imágenes | 29 790 208 | 30 982 144 | 33 546 240 | 4 | 8,3 |\n"
"| Número de objetos | 351 565 | 353 273 | 356 059 | 0,5 | 0,8 |\n"
"| Tamaño de los recursos | 169 205 | 174 761 | 175 392 | 3,3 | 0,36 |\n"
